<div class="px-4 py-3 rounded mb-4 bg-gray-100 border border-gray-400 text-gray-700 flex relative" role="alert" data-controller="alert">
  <i class="fa fa-info-circle me-2 fa-2x"></i>
  <div>
    <p class="<%= 'mb-0' if user_signed_in? %>">
      The Quran Image Export tool allows you to render and download high-resolution PNG and WEBP images for any Mushaf page, Ayah, or Word.
      We can adjust Quran scripts, font size, line height, background color, and transparency to accurately represent and export Quranic text.
    </p>

    <% unless user_signed_in? %>
      <p class="mb-0">
        If you'd like to download or batch-export images, simply login or create an account. Once logged in, you'll be able to download high-resolution PNG and WEBP images.
      </p>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
